supralinux-theme (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Port the validated Aurora host theme to the real package IDs.
  * Ship light and dark global themes, Plasma styles, color schemes and
    previews; both global themes use the dark Aurora splash.
  * Add the KDE 3 - SupraLINUX sound theme with its GPL-2.0-only license,
    logout WAV hook and system-ready SDDM accent.
  * Fix GTK dark-mode imports and icon-theme scalable metadata.
  * Drop the legacy org.kde.supralinux.desktop global theme and the old
    Supralinux sound theme.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000

supralinux-theme (1.0.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Aurora theme package for SupraLINUX 1.0.0.
  * Include dark and light global themes, Plasma styles, SDDM theme, sounds
    and GTK defaults.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
